@KameronSushi.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

GET {{KameronSushi.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

###

GET {{KameronSushi.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Verificación de Meta (reemplazar solo en el cliente local; no guardar el secreto)

GET {{KameronSushi.Api_HostAddress}}/webhooks/whatsapp?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.verify_token=TOKEN_LOCAL&hub.challenge=123456
Accept: text/plain

###

GET {{KameronSushi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pos/catalog
Accept: application/json

### Crear un pedido. Reemplazar los identificadores con valores de /api/pos/catalog.
### En un producto sin configuración, optionId, productWrapperId y sauceId deben ser null.

POST {{KameronSushi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pos/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "optionId": null,
      "productWrapperId": null,
      "sauceId": null,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "payments": [
    {
      "method": "efectivo",
      "amount": 10000
    }
  ]
}

###

GET {{KameronSushi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pos/orders?limit=50
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{KameronSushi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pos/orders/1
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{KameronSushi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/kitchen/orders
Accept: application/json

###

PATCH {{KameronSushi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/kitchen/orders/1/ready
Accept: application/json

###
